  "description": "A LiteDB-compatible document database API backed by Microsoft SQL Server. Keeps the LiteDB programming model - collections, BsonDocument, LINQ queries, indexes, transactions, DbRef and file storage - while storing documents as queryable JSON in SQL Server tables. Indexes are backed by persisted computed columns, so LINQ predicates seek rather than scan.",
